# DeployerX

- Session orientation: `STATUS.md` + `ROADMAP.md` (see session-loop rule).
- Cascade: `_global` → L1 → L2 → L3. Local wins. L3 = deltas only.
- Playbooks: `/playbooks` + `_registry.yaml`. Never fork per city.
- After locale/playbook/field-note edits: `make site && make check`
- Tone: precise engineering docs. No slogan spam in schemas or code comments.
